message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Cite it as software
  (research prototype, not an independently validated scientific method —
  see the README's Status section), and disclose which components you
  relied on, since the codebase mixes independently-cited correlations
  with in-house, unvalidated heuristics.
title: >-
  CEREBRO-X: A Computational Research Pipeline (Prototype) with Integrated
  Machine-Learning Modules for CNS Drug Delivery System Exploration
